On go-live, the old system stays accessible but stops accepting new work.

- **Read-only mode**: the old inbox or tracker is switched to read-only so no new requests can come in through it [1].
- **Full cutover**: all new requests flow through Northline exclusively from that point on [1].
- **Timing**: this happens on Day 5 of the standard rollout, after channels are connected and the team is invited [1].

For a full walkthrough of the rollout steps, see [Onboarding guide](https://northline.com/onboarding).
